                "function": "operations",
                "security-severity": "5.0",
                "stride": "information-disclosure"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "unencrypted-communication",
              "name": "Unencrypted Communication",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Due to the confidentiality and/or integrity rating of the data assets transferred over the communication link this connection must be encrypted."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "If this risk is unmitigated, network attackers might be able to to eavesdrop on unencrypted sensitive data sent between components.\n\nMitigation: Apply transport layer encryption to the communication link."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Are recommendations from the linked cheat sheet and referenced ASVS chapter applied?"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Transport_Layer_Protection_Cheat_Sheet.html",
              "properties": {
                "cwe": "CWE-319",
                "function": "operations",
                "security-severity": "6.5",
                "stride": "information-disclosure"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "unguarded-access-from-internet",
              "name": "Unguarded Access From Internet",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Internet-exposed assets must be guarded by a protecting service, application, or reverse-proxy."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "If this risk is unmitigated, attackers might be able to directly attack sensitive systems without any hardening components in-between due to them being directly exposed on the internet.\n\nMitigation: Encapsulate the asset behind a guarding service, application, or reverse-proxy. For admin maintenance a bastion-host should be used as a jump-server. For file transfer a store-and-forward-host should be used as an indirect file exchange platform."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Are recommendations from the linked cheat sheet and referenced ASVS chapter applied?"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Attack_Surface_Analysis_Cheat_Sheet.html",
              "properties": {
                "cwe": "CWE-501",
                "function": "architecture",
                "security-severity": "6.5",
                "stride": "elevation-of-privilege"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "unguarded-direct-datastore-access",
              "name": "Unguarded Direct Datastore Access",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Data stores accessed across trust boundaries must be guarded by some protecting service or application."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "If this risk is unmitigated, attackers might be able to directly attack sensitive data stores without any protecting components in-between.\n\nMitigation: Encapsulate the datastore access behind a guarding service or application."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Are recommendations from the linked cheat sheet and referenced ASVS chapter applied?"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Attack_Surface_Analysis_Cheat_Sheet.html",
              "properties": {
                "cwe": "CWE-501",
                "function": "architecture",
                "security-severity": "6.5",
                "stride": "elevation-of-privilege"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "unnecessary-technical-asset",
              "name": "Unnecessary Technical Asset",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "When a technical asset does not process any data assets, this is an indicator for an unnecessary technical asset (or for an incomplete model). This is also the case if the asset has no communication links (either outgoing or incoming)."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "If this risk is unmitigated, attackers might be able to target unnecessary technical assets.\n\nMitigation: Try to avoid using technical assets that do not process or store anything."
              },
              "help": {
                "text": "Are recommendations from the linked cheat sheet and referenced ASVS chapter applied?"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://cheatsheetseries.owasp.org/cheatsheets/Attack_Surface_Analysis_Cheat_Sheet.html",
